# Apple design review (HIG)

When reviewing or improving UI/UX, follow the process in `vendor/agents/apple-design-skill/`:

1. Read `vendor/agents/apple-design-skill/SKILL.md` in full (principles, lenses, report format).
2. Read `vendor/agents/apple-design-skill/references/hig-lookup.md` to route topics.
3. Load only the needed `references/hig/*.md` files (3–6), plus `references/cross-platform.md` for React/Next.js vocabulary.
4. Cite findings as `file.md › Heading` with a short quote; tag Critical / High / Medium / Low.
5. For **in-app copy**, also apply `docs/skills/kokonus/ui-ringkas/SKILL.md` (Indonesia, pengguna 40+, bukan Apple English labels).

Trigger: design review, UI audit, accessibility check, layout improvement, app icon, onboarding, or visual/interaction feedback on screenshots or components.
